{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06068","headline":"三月三日勤政楼侍宴应制 · 王维","name":"三月三日勤政楼侍宴应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"彩仗连宵合，琼楼拂曙通。\n年光三月里，宫殿百花中。\n不数秦王日，谁将洛水同。\n酒筵嫌落絮，舞袖怯春风。\n天保无爲德，人欢不战功。\n仍临九衢宴，更达四门聪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06068.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06068","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}